2026-10-28T17:39:00.2829458Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Eg2hapYeEwdmU7Nn7xQqk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"number\": 22,\n3\t  \"url\": \"https://github.com/wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent/issues/22\",\n4\t  \"repo\": \"wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent\",\n5\t  \"title\": \"Lambda ESM metrics_config missing options\",\n6\t  \"body\": \"### Description\\n\\nLambda ESM metrics_config accepts more than just EventCount:\\nhttps://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/blob/f4fd2723ed647078bced4bdf4b83e6a61c379546/service/lambda/types/enums.go#L147-L154\\n\\nThe version of the AWS SDK for Go should be updated to allow the new values to be used.\\n\\n### Affected Resource(s) or Data Source(s)\\n\\n* `aws_lambda_event_source_mapping`\\n\\n### Potential Terraform Configuration\\n\\nNotice new values `ErrorCount` and `KafkaMetrics`:\\n```hcl\\nresource \\\"aws_lambda_event_source_mapping\\\" \\\"test\\\" {\\n  event_source_arn = aws_sqs_queue.test.arn\\n  function_name    = aws_lambda_function.test.arn\\n\\n  metrics_config {\\n    metrics = [\\\"EventCount\\\", \\\"ErrorCount\\\", \\\"KafkaMetrics\\\"]\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n\\n### References\\n\\nhttps://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2026/01/aws-Lambda-observability-for-kafka-esm/:\\n\\n> Similarly, customers can enable one or more metrics groups\\u2014EventCount, ErrorCount, and KafkaMetrics\\u2014to monitor various aspects of event processing. \\n\\n### Would you like to implement the enhancement?\\n\\nYes\\n\",\n7\t  \"author\": \"zzzinn\",\n8\t  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n9\t  \"labels\": [\n10\t    \"enhancement\"\n11\t  ],\n12\t  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T17:08:58Z\",\n13\t  \"as_of\": \"2026-07-20T11:21:42Z\"\n14\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d91cf4f-deb6-4686-be5d-82854981ce48","uuid":"d4f834ec-058f-4984-a365-75e318d81720","timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:39:00.277Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/gh-aw/agent/issue.json","content":"{\n  \"number\": 22,\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent/issues/22\",\n  \"repo\": \"wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent\",\n  \"title\": \"Lambda ESM metrics_config missing options\",\n  \"body\": \"### Description\\n\\nLambda ESM metrics_config accepts more than just EventCount:\\nhttps://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/blob/f4fd2723ed647078bced4bdf4b83e6a61c379546/service/lambda/types/enums.go#L147-L154\\n\\nThe version of the AWS SDK for Go should be updated to allow the new values to be used.\\n\\n### Affected Resource(s) or Data Source(s)\\n\\n* `aws_lambda_event_source_mapping`\\n\\n### Potential Terraform Configuration\\n\\nNotice new values `ErrorCount` and `KafkaMetrics`:\\n```hcl\\nresource \\\"aws_lambda_event_source_mapping\\\" \\\"test\\\" {\\n  event_source_arn = aws_sqs_queue.test.arn\\n  function_name    = aws_lambda_function.test.arn\\n\\n  metrics_config {\\n    metrics = [\\\"EventCount\\\", \\\"ErrorCount\\\", \\\"KafkaMetrics\\\"]\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n\\n### References\\n\\nhttps://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2026/01/aws-Lambda-observability-for-kafka-esm/:\\n\\n> Similarly, customers can enable one or more metrics groups\\u2014EventCount, ErrorCount, and KafkaMetrics\\u2014to monitor various aspects of event processing. \\n\\n### Would you like to implement the enhancement?\\n\\nYes\\n\",\n  \"author\": \"zzzinn\",\n  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n  \"labels\": [\n    \"enhancement\"\n  ],\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T17:08:58Z\",\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-07-20T11:21:42Z\"\n}","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012Eg2hapYeEwdmU7Nn7xQqk","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
