azon Kinesis, and Amazon DynamoDB event sources. * [Announcement]( * [Blog post]( * aws_lambda_event_source_mapping terraform resource \\\"aws_lambda_event_source_mapping\\\" \\\"example\\\" { metrics_c\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2024-11-22T19:43:36Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.36,\n      \"band\": \"possible\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 28875,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#28875\",\n      \"title\": \"[Enhancement]: Add support for Lambda SQS Event Source maximum concurrency\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"Add support for Lambda SQS Event Source maximum concurrency. * aws_lambda_event_source_mapping terraform resource \\\"aws_lambda_event_source_mapping\\\" \\\"example\\\" { event_source_arn = aws_sqs_queue.sqs_queue_test.arn function_name = aws_lambda_function.example.arn scaling_config { maximum_concurrency = 5 } } - Announcement: - API: - Requires AWS Go SDK v1.44.179: - Blog post:\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2023-01-13T11:12:27Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.221,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 39849,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#39849\",\n      \"title\": \"[Bug]: Error: listing tags for Lambda Event Source Mapping\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"1.9.5 5.72.1 * aws_lambda_event_source_mapping no error errors during plan shell Error: listing tags for Lambda Event Source Mapping (arn:aws:lambda:us-west-2::event-source-mapping:xxx-xxx-xxx): operation error Lambda: ListTags, https response error StatusCode: 400, RequestID: xxx-xxx-xxx, InvalidParameterValueException: Unsupported resource type for tagging or invalid arn: arn:aws:lambda:us-west-\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2024-10-23T08:21:46Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.195,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 45662,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#45662\",\n      \"title\": \"`aws_lambda_event_source_mapping` is missing some arguments\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"Hello, AWS now supports specifying a kafka:// as an on-failure destination for Kakfa-based Lambda event source mappings: For now, this type of value is rejected by Terraform (the error says that it is not a valid ARN). Also, it seems like Terraform is missing the PollerGroupName parameter in provisioned_poller_config as described in - aws_lambda_event_source_mapping The pollers provisioning config\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2025-12-19T09:46:06Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.187,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 45801,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#45801\",\n      \"title\": \"`aws_lambda_event_source_mapping` should support `kafka://<topic>` on-failure destinations\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"AWS now supports specifying values in the form kafka:// as an [on-failure destination for Kakfa-based Lambda event source mappings]( For now, this type of value is rejected by Terraform (because it is not a valid ARN). The validation function should check if it's either a valid ARN, or a kafka:// URL. * aws_lambda_event_source_mapping hcl resource aws_lambda_event_source_mapping esm { destination_\",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-01-05T11:48:41Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.181,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"corpus_size\": 11402,\n  \"thresholds\": {\n    \"likely\": 0.4,\n    \"possible\": 0.28\n  }\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d91cf4f-deb6-4686-be5d-82854981ce48","uuid":"181ac3c7-69fd-4c19-8c6b-50369c86309e","timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:39:01.728Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 22,\n    \"title\": \"Lambda ESM metrics_config missing options\",\n    \"author_associa